  "kanji": "凌",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 凌\ntitle: endure; surpass\njlpt: 1\ntags: [jlpt-n1, grade-9, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 10\nradical: 冫\nradicalNumber: 15\nonyomi: [リョウ]\nkunyomi: [しの.ぐ]\nquizOnyomi: [リョウ]\nquizKunyomi: [しの.ぐ]\ndistractors: [准, 冶, 冴]\n---\n\n# 凌 — endure; surpass\n\n**Strokes:** 10 · **Key (radical):** 冫 (the two left-hand strokes, no. 15) · **JLPT:** N1 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n凌 has two useful branches: **enduring or getting through a difficulty**, and\n**surpassing something else**. In [凌ぐ](../words/凌ぐ.md) (しのぐ), the\ncontext selects between these branches. [凌駕](../words/凌駕.md) (りょうが)\nconcerns surpassing, not sheltering from bad weather.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** imagine the two 冫 marks as drops\nbeside the right-hand 夌 shape, pictured as a barrier. Think of weathering\nthe drops or getting beyond the barrier. This is an invented memory scene,\nnot a historical derivation or a verified explanation of the sound.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| リョウ | on | [凌駕](../words/凌駕.md) りょうが — surpassing; outdoing |\n| しの.ぐ | kun | [凌ぐ](../words/凌ぐ.md) しのぐ — endure; surpass |\n\nBoth readings in the frozen KANJIDIC2 record are selected for practice.\nIts grade-9/name-use classification does not make these ordinary word\nreadings personal-name readings; names are not taught here.\n\n## Common words\n\n- [凌ぐ](../words/凌ぐ.md) しのぐ — endure or pull through; surpass\n- [凌駕](../words/凌駕.md) りょうが — surpassing; outdoing, also with する\n\n## Notes\n\n- 凌ぐ is a ぐ-ending verb: しのぎます, しのいで, しのいだ.\n  Do not confuse it with the separate verb 忍ぶ (しのぶ), which ends in ぶ.\n- 陵 (りょう; みささぎ) has 阝 on the left rather than 凌's two 冫 strokes.\n  Recognizing the rarer spelling 陵駕 (りょうが) does not make these\n  characters freely interchangeable in other words.\n- Compare [准](准.md), \"quasi-; associate rank,\" with 隹 on the right;\n  [冶](冶.md), \"smelt; work metals,\" with [台](台.md); and [次](次.md),\n  \"next,\" with [欠](欠.md). Similar left-hand marks do not imply the same meaning.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), database 2026-306, 2026-11-02 (EDRDG; [CC BY-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)).\nWords: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1554200, 1606270 and 1467450.\nUsage: [Digital Daijisen: 凌ぐ](https://kotobank.jp/word/凌ぐ-522598) and [凌駕](https://kotobank.jp/word/凌駕-659109).\n",
